{
  "id": 10000075,
  "name": "流浪者",
  "enName": "Wanderer",
  "title": "久世浮倾",
  "element": "风",
  "region": "须弥",
  "rarity": 5,
  "weapon": "法器",
  "birthday": "1月3日",
  "constellation": "浪客座",
  "description": "身份成谜的流浪人士。衣着打扮像是修验者，言行却并不是修验者应有的模样。",
  "affiliation": "无",
  "cv": {
    "chinese": "鹿喑",
    "japanese": "柿原彻也",
    "english": "帕特里克·佩德拉萨",
    "korean": "闵丞釪"
  },
  "avatarImg": "assets/characters/10000075-avatar.webp",
  "splashArt": "assets/characters/10000075-art.webp",
  "hasLocalPack": false,
  "voicePackageUrl": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Wanderer.zip",
  "voicePackageEn": "Wanderer",
  "quoteCount": 84,
  "friendLines": [
    {
      "title": "初次见面…",
      "desc": "要我报上名来？此行世间，我名号诸多，虽然随便一个对凡人来说都高不可及，但于我都已成过往。\n想称呼什么就随你吧，让我见识下你的品味，可别让我失望。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_draw_appear_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/36/8w3h83aizhf5k3ea4govcoafy8o5vob.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·风",
      "desc": "这世上没有纯粹的自由。风也会有吹到头的时候。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_character_idle_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/08/6xev38ny054ys4ehssokh10vg8lxvbd.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·说话方式",
      "desc": "我说话刻薄吗？只是实话实说罢了，接受不了的人才该自己反思原因。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_character_idle_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/7rbo09as8ht816thn0pc3mj2ozjdjaa.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·寒暄",
      "desc": "寒暄就免了吧，没话找话的样子也太可笑了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_character_idle_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/jhrf7qwdota2r5kfr1ud77pexr7o2o7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雨的时候…",
      "desc": "想用我的斗笠遮雨？亏你提得出这种要求。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_weather_heavyRain_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/hih1lyqgm7mnloj09ztc1bvoiwflgp0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "雨过天晴…",
      "desc": "见了点阳光就能高兴成这个样子？幼稚。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_weather_afterRain_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/sb490v2gw40w06vjqe3dahhooxr1y7g.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "打雷的时候…",
      "desc": "啧…烦心。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_weather_thunder_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dd/ef14e3ec2tvt88n2ebx3wy4lwltvudb.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雪的时候…",
      "desc": "明明和雨没什么区别，却讨人喜欢多了…真是人各有命。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_weather_snowy_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1c/dwdyo977dhlp6hm4icjwqonxnmo4qfr.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "刮大风了…",
      "desc": "这点程度，你都能做到吧？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_weather_gale_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/qk4qosfs28hsp1trq2cbln3niar6df1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "早上好…",
      "desc": "「快醒醒——太阳要晒屁股咯——」…哈，你不会以为我会这么叫你起床吧？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_greetingMorning",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/35/pwuoj43hg4q0b584k5zjfw72k5v8x7o.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "中午好…",
      "desc": "我不需要吃饭。管好你自己和身边的小东西，就算是让我省心了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_greetingNoon",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4d/8m74x6pma9dxdw7t0k6hz6ozxg0e3yf.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚上好…",
      "desc": "终于，无聊的一天就要结束了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_greetingNight",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/df/igqza2gjqpzwu1clvccfp6rwryhbawm.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚安…",
      "desc": "在我身边睡不着吗？呵呵。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_greetingNight2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/gyka47lzt9v05dn231hz5l6dpq7gdaz.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "#关于{REALNAME[ID(1)]}自己·人偶",
      "desc": "烧掉一个人偶会留下灰烬。至于灰烬中会诞生什么…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_idle",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/8a/VO_ZH_Wanderer_About_Wanderer_-_Puppet.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "#关于{REALNAME[ID(1)]}自己·心",
      "desc": "那种东西随便了。执着于注定不属于自己的事物只是在浪费时间，现在的我有更重要的事情要做。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_idle2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/d4/VO_ZH_Wanderer_About_Wanderer_-_Heart.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·对手",
      "desc": "对你我以前的对峙耿耿于怀？哦。所以呢，你要怎么做？慢慢想，我不急。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_close",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/e4i4mrimjzf8wcidb7grenlct869rlx.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·同伙",
      "desc": "我不可能皈依「正义」，但既然说过要偿还你的恩情，就定会做到。\n倒是你，在和我接触的时候可能需要想想自己立场哦？万一被人撞见，说你与罪人「狼狈为奸」，我可概不负责。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_close1",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/ls6hlbzdpnpqmnsp7xebkjhzk1veqr5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「神之眼」…",
      "desc": "所谓「神明的注视」令人不爽，但反正是可用的力量，我不挑。你觉得「风元素」有其深意？呵，为什么会这么想？神明行事蛮横又无理，我不是让你领教过吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_pendant",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c1/fqcmyeb56e3e2wg1cext7gsr6sqocn7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "有什么想要分享…",
      "desc": "没有。你想问什么就问吧，我看心情回答。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_share_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/n11s5g5a6w2b0oxbgadj5tuskdoggvh.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "感兴趣的见闻…",
      "desc": "看啊，鸟雀会炫耀羽毛，松鼠忙着囤积食物，人类为了柴米油盐整日奔走。头脑简单的生物活得就是比较容易呢。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_pref_gift_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f3/jb77l4w03qzkfya02aila1ye3lwfwe3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于小吉祥草王…",
      "desc": "她选择不除掉我，或许不只是因为我有利用价值。也许是因为她很贤明，又有至善之心，又或许，是她在我身上看到了孤独的影子…你说我是在恶意揣测？哈，这不是当然的事情嘛！我又不是什么好人。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_nahida_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/2ywqn6dakquzu043g1dq2wojld8xxak.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于雷电将军…",
      "desc": "对自己的造物视若不见，却又美其名曰不忍心干预…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_raidenShogun_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e3/4pcamr6nfptt0r1nghlaw8u8iakwsw3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「女皇」…",
      "desc": "人人都称赞她的温柔与慈爱，却不知「爱」也是「罪」的一种。搞不好是代偿心理作祟哦？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_tsaritsa_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/o4qtd1w3xy9v3b1f4w56kpsswz2ja69.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「丑角」…",
      "desc": "「丑角」是坎瑞亚的遗民——除此之外，我对他知之甚少，也从未与他有过什么密切的交流。但他似乎对我意有所求，以前给我指派过不少重要的任务，包括前往「深渊」。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_pierro_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/37m1xh6aebranzlimzzl78v5eg282an.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「队长」…",
      "desc": "「刚正不阿的『队长』」、「正直果敢的『队长』」、「战功累累的『队长』」…这些愚人众里流传的言论，就算是人偶的耳朵也要听出茧子来了。你不觉得，绝对的「正直」，其实是个极其危险的隐患吗？更不用提，「队长」拥有顶尖的实力。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_capitano_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/8r2y53p50uga59ibdpdzkpme942fewg.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「博士」…",
      "desc": "真遗憾，小吉祥草王让他消除了那么多的切片，剥夺了我将他一片一片千刀万剐的快乐。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_dottore_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/ne8disybh8nskqq6jbk4rks6jfbz2fa.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「少女」…",
      "desc": "试问：当遇到一名「无论何时」都懵懂无知，「无论做什么」都麻木平淡的「少女」时，该作何反应？我的话，尚可一战；你的话…因为太有良知，还是离她远些吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_columbina_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/70/gx8abuaalt6et5d426lrivrk0rs7jmi.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「仆人」…",
      "desc": "道貌岸然的伪君子。她对人展露「优雅」与「亲切」都只是为了更好地「控制」罢了。而直面过她疯狂一面的人，大多已经…呼~。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_arlecchino_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/rxjoow5zl66q1oicip9jdfpofbkk2xs.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「公鸡」…",
      "desc": "也就是「公子」才会觉得「公鸡」是真心实意、不求回报地关心他和他的家人。虽然那位市长大人确实做了不少实事，但稍微有点脑子的人都能看出来，这里的潜台词是「你的家人都在我掌控之中」吧？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_pulcinella_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/rgu7e089m3f5m1oeqouxh9ogt9m6sao.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「木偶」…",
      "desc": "她除了自己的研究以外什么都不关心，性格恶劣得很。但即便做到如此极端的地步，却也只是制造了大量废品，在我仍是执行官时还低我一席，真是可怜。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_sandrone_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/q5f83i0wcd0728sjvoluhve3eayz3bo.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「富人」…",
      "desc": "那个第九席啊，他对「公平交易」过分偏执，甚至试图推翻神与人之间天生的不平等。不过凡人就是这样，容易有不切实际的妄想，倒也没什么特别的，就像他平庸的能力和眼光一样——选择和「博士」密切合作，哼，是不会有好下场的。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_pantalone_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/nszc2b8omdskxpb9i4q3vv4yrkgdox7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「公子」…",
      "desc": "头脑简单，四肢也不甚发达。让他做最后一席都是在拉低执行官的整体水准。万幸，我已经不在其列了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_tartaglia_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/61/6lnvuyl692mnupzdtdmjoh9zjtk1xgh.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「女士」…",
      "desc": "她的灰烬里什么都没有。我对失去未来的人不感兴趣。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_signora_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/5npy9j2xezje8e11ns3q587as0r29wq.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于八重神子…",
      "desc": "油腔滑调的妖怪，为博神明的青睐，将自己伪装成关心人类的样子。其实，只是为了找乐子吧？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_yaeMiko_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e8/jh46dp9a18hlc35rvggt7aezrk53svw.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于枫原万叶…",
      "desc": "你说枫原家的后人？那岂不是…哦？他也有风元素的「神之眼」，还扛下过雷电将军的一刀？呵呵…哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_kazuha_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/eb/fv5jxbemwly54q4gjyxuwm8zrl1yuy9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于赛索斯…",
      "desc": "你为什么觉得我会认识他？就因为他经常追在我后面吵着要看我的帽子吗？我们没怎么说过话，第一次见面他就问我是不是叫阿帽，这又何尝不是以貌取人？哼，阿帽，这个名字倒是流传开了…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_teammate_sethos_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/3t8bouh1jz6tr2jamsj3n0d96xpn6ma.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "#想要了解{REALNAME[ID(1)]}·其一",
      "desc": "真稀奇，竟然想了解我。会招来麻烦哦？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_friendship_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/bd/VO_ZH_Wanderer_More_About_Wanderer_-_01.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "#想要了解{REALNAME[ID(1)]}·其二",
      "desc": "啊，一定有很多、很多人想要找我清算前尘。无所谓，我来者不拒——或者说，还挺期待的呢。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_friendship_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b0/VO_ZH_Wanderer_More_About_Wanderer_-_02.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "#想要了解{REALNAME[ID(1)]}·其三",
      "desc": "我曾以为成神便可摒弃无用的情感，现在不这么觉得了。至少「愤怒」，无论来自他人还是自我，都是方便使用的工具。\n怎么会有人永远不生气呢？难以想象，这种人就没有一点脾气吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_friendship_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/e7/VO_ZH_Wanderer_More_About_Wanderer_-_03.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "#想要了解{REALNAME[ID(1)]}·其四",
      "desc": "在进入世界树时，我心中只有一个念头：希望自己从未来到这个世上。\n世界树回应了这个愿望，却没有带来我期盼的结果。这片土地的命运在捉弄它的囚徒方面一如往常。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_friendship_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dc/VO_ZH_Wanderer_More_About_Wanderer_-_04.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "#想要了解{REALNAME[ID(1)]}·其五",
      "desc": "你我有过交点，但终有一天会去往不同的地方。谁知道以后会发生什么呢？走着瞧吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_friendship_05",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/86/VO_ZH_Wanderer_More_About_Wanderer_-_05.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)]}的爱好…",
      "desc": "爱好？那是闲人才有空琢磨的东西吧，我看起来像是没事做吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_pref_hobby",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b6/VO_ZH_Wanderer_Hobbies.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)]}的烦恼…",
      "desc": "在想怎么才能把你甩掉，去胡作非为一番。——开玩笑的，你信了？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_dialog_annoyed",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/80/VO_ZH_Wanderer_Troubles.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "喜欢的食物…",
      "desc": "有茶吗？越苦越好，回味无穷。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_pref_foodLike_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/698pc39aarjub7nvudccg219k7if5p7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "讨厌的食物…",
      "desc": "腻腻歪歪的甜东西，牙齿都要被黏在一起了。你自己留着吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_pref_foodDislike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/89/1wwav1j5k1e7aosgmwkyx6nd0htte2b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其一",
      "desc": "还行吧，算是你为数不多的优点了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_spice_pref_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/6ava4b24z3t1rzcfkjty6rphu001rye.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其二",
      "desc": "不错，至少做出了能入口的食物。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_spice_normal_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/mjj2ptv2jes4ryqjcfupssrgck4it7b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其三",
      "desc": "想害我？难不成你笨到忘了我非凡胎？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_spice_dislike_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e8/a321totdau5ij7p0lggnzwgvw5xit37.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "生日…",
      "desc": "把手给我。…呵，别紧张啊，只是带你去高处看看而已。\n如何？应当是非凡的景色。感谢就免了，谢来谢去的没意思。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_pref_birthday_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/d0t7a402zy7ek4bil73aw3hplfbx5se.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·起",
      "desc": "…看得出来，你尽力了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_starUp_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ca/1f2vio2m1r6udghklweo4f39ry4xx0t.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·承",
      "desc": "风吹过来了…你做了什么？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_starUp_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/58/tvos5a3jxv6a5yble1z3l0iudln0b1r.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·转",
      "desc": "给我力量，你不担心后果吗？…好吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_starUp_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9b/1c9ls6kfujanv8wi5exm2y97dvb8e61.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·合",
      "desc": "虽说我可以成为你的助力，但将我视作同伴仍是件危险的事情，希望你清楚自己在面对什么。若你不畏惧，便站到我身后吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_wanderer/vo_wanderer_starUp_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/ooda4kbfvf7s7w5upfwge0vkc9zmjuv.mp3"
    }
  ],
